## Story Description
Update src/utils/generate_test_data.py to produce more realistic procurement data. The generator must still work with the existing CLI interface (--rows, --seed, --output, --messiness). Add: (1) tail spend concentration — generate 2-3 anchor suppliers that collectively receive ~40% of rows, rest distributed across many tail suppliers; (2) maverick spend — approximately 15% of rows should have empty PO_NUM; (3) credit notes — approximately 3% of rows have negative AMT and INV_NO prefixed with 'CN-'; (4) missing cost centre — approximately 5% of rows have empty COST_CTR. The existing currencies, pay terms variants, and GL ranges should be preserved.

